  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "나이스 맨홀!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C774C2A40020B9E8D64000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스톱!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D1B10021002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가만히 서서\n발밑을 확인해 보시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B9CCD7880020C11CC11C000ABC1CBC11C7440020D655C778D5740020BCF4C2DCC8E0002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티에는\n포켓몬이 그려진 맨홀이 있답니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0B294000AD3ECCF13BAACC7740020ADF8B824C9C40020B9E8D640C7740020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이름하여 포켓몬 맨홀!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B984D558C5EC0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020B9E8D640002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그중 하나가 바로 이것이구요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8C9110020D558B098AC000020BC14B85C0020C774AC83C774AD6CC694002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "베르 지구는\n고고트가 맨홀에 그려져 있어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA0B9740020C9C0AD6CB294000AACE0ACE0D2B8AC000020B9E8D640C5D00020ADF8B824C8380020C788C5B4C694002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 그럼\n퀴즈를 내 보죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020ADF8B7FC000AD034C988B97C0020B0B40020BCF4C8E0002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루주 지구의 맨홀에 그려져 있는\n포켓몬은 누굴까요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n정답이다 싶은 포켓몬을\n제게 보여 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8C8FC0020C9C0AD6CC7580020B9E8D640C5D00020ADF8B824C8380020C788B294000AD3ECCF13BAACC7400020B204AD74AE4CC694003F00100001BE01000AC815B2F5C774B2E40020C2F6C7400020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AC81CAC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루주 지구의 맨홀에 그려져 있는\n포켓몬을 보여 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8C8FC0020C9C0AD6CC7580020B9E8D640C5D00020ADF8B824C8380020C788B294000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보여 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정답이다 싶은 포켓몬을 데려와서\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B2F5C774B2E40020C2F6C7400020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020B370B824C640C11C000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어느 포켓몬이 맨홀에 그려져 있는지\n정답을 보여 주시죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B2900020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B9E8D640C5D00020ADF8B824C8380020C788B294C9C0000AC815B2F5C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC2DCC8E0002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정답인 포켓몬을 찾으시거든\n제게 보여 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B2F5C7780020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020CC3EC73CC2DCAC70B4E0000AC81CAC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안타깝지만 틀렸어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548D0C0AE5DC9C0B9CC0020D2C0B838C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수컷 화염레오...\n거의 맞히셨지만 틀렸어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218CEF70020D654C5FCB808C624002E002E002E000AAC70C7580020B9DED788C168C9C0B9CC0020D2C0B838C5B4C694002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "암컷 화염레오...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C554CEF70020D654C5FCB808C624002E002E002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "딩동댕동~♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B529B3D9B315B3D9007E266A00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "훌륭해요! 정답이에요!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6CCB96DD574C69400210020C815B2F5C774C5D0C6940021002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 맨홀에는 저마다 테마가 있어요.\n루주 지구의 테마는 ‘정열’...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n암컷 화염레오와 잘 어울리는 테마죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020B9E8D640C5D0B2940020C800B9C8B2E40020D14CB9C8AC000020C788C5B4C694002E000AB8E8C8FC0020C9C0AD6CC7580020D14CB9C8B29400202018C815C5F42019002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC554CEF70020D654C5FCB808C624C6400020C7980020C5B4C6B8B9ACB2940020D14CB9C8C8E0003F00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로 다른 맨홀들의 경우...\n베르 지구는 ‘우애’, 블르 지구는 ‘겸허’,<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n로즈 지구는 ‘기품’, 그리고\n존느 지구는 ‘쾌활’이 테마라고 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가끔씩은 맨홀을 확인하며\n걷는 것도 좋지 않을까요?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n물론 앞도 잘 보고 걸어야겠지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
